pr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44f208e7f231eebc9d36feb4fcf31ec7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "If it is okay, I would like to request an illustration of Momiji Inubashiri as a Deino:\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/111585668\nMomiji is a character from Touhou who, with the collar equipped onto her, became a Deino with her form being locked as a Deino until the collar is removed by the character who put it on her. \nPersonality-wise, she can be said to be usually serious and cooperative, but not submissive. As a Deino, Momiji additionally tends to act shyer than usual because of the circumstances of being turned into a Deino.\n\nHere are a few more references of Deino Momiji:\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/99614801\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/106618779\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/113482442\n\nI wouldn't have any other specifications for this so feel welcome to draw her however you want.\n\nThank you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/92b5bce0/uploads/origins/756a2cad-ec6b-4701-86dc-3f2a5208ccd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fa180f3dd499780c97163c9acdb2216", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92b5bce0/uploads/origins/756a2cad-ec6b-4701-86dc-3f2a5208ccd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fa180f3dd499780c97163c9acdb2216, https://si.imgix.net/92b5bce0/uploads/origins/756a2cad-ec6b-4701-86dc-3f2a5208ccd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c383a26b772392f2985896e0d480d031 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92b5bce0/uploads/origins/756a2cad-ec6b-4701-86dc-3f2a5208ccd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87b4e19ffd2ad43d5b5de0b6535c390e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Greetings Toarutaro!\n\nI've looked at your past works and really love your art, so I thought I would commission