qa&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3260bdf/uploads/origins/d4ab20b9-d748-40d3-bec0-630585694e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fd975252dbdb191cb9270f73a791fd4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3260bdf/uploads/origins/d4ab20b9-d748-40d3-bec0-630585694e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fd975252dbdb191cb9270f73a791fd4, https://si.imgix.net/c3260bdf/uploads/origins/d4ab20b9-d748-40d3-bec0-630585694e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f4195c7a14274472bedce9e35cdbf89 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3260bdf/uploads/origins/d4ab20b9-d748-40d3-bec0-630585694e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f212c57078b691f5e4202130438bf49 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, hope you having a great day,\n\nI loved the last piece you did for me! I'd love a new piece on my Snivy Marmalade sitting in a field with a basket of oranges next to her. I'm not too worried about what else will be in the background.\n\nReference:\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/m8dis9b5gj6b63dyg8qeu/Marmalade.jpg?rlkey=dyxpasql3srq8kountjyejxlo&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a813554e/uploads/origins/c6b912b8-bb46-424a-99e7-05b483ac44f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9347af837791c621f191f37032599747", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a813554e/uploads/origins/c6b912b8-bb46-424a-99e7-05b483ac44f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9347af837791c621f191f37032599747, https://si.imgix.net/a813554e/uploads/origins/c6b912b8-bb46-424a-99e7-05b483ac44f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d3c00728df85b3d8b33c99498e3acb7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a813554e/uploads/origins/c6b912b8-bb46-424a-99e7-05b483ac44f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8798bef2bf453826593300035385ac71 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would like to request a cute illustration of a ミズゴロウ! ミズゴロウ is happily eating a whole plate of delicious, freshly-baked cookies along with a glass of milk! 🍪🥛 You could also draw ミズゴロウ being cozied up in a warm blanket or near a fireplace too as he eats the cookies! Other than that, feel free to choose whatever else you would like to include for the illustration!\n\nThank you very much! 💙", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8767d3e8/uploads/origins/4923d86c-9b0a-4265-aff4-de3b6964cc03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=440e22a598b37c1766513646746578fb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8767d3e8/uploads/origins/4923d86c-9b0a-4265-aff4-de3b6964cc03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=440e22a598b37c1766513646746578fb, https://si.imgix.net/8767d3e8/uploads/origins/4923d86c-9b0a-4265-aff4-de3b6964cc03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0363708b8533e172382592405c0cce0a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8767d3e8/uploads/origins/4923d86c-9b0a-4265-aff4-de3b6964cc03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7df6c92c44dc440db814d2a6d679c736 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nCould you draw my Vaporeon character? She has a mischievous and confident personality.\nI would like to see her kneeling in front of the viewer, with a smug and alluring expression.\nSomething similar to this would be great: https://twitter.com/toarutaro3/status/1696162592035635214\nThank you :3\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sY5fH40", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d5471d5/uploads/origins/ecc1cbc0-fb85-4aec-bee3-0391dd5471fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c62ed5e5da1fa532060048ab30ebc6a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d5471d5/uploads/origins/ecc1cbc0-fb85-4aec-bee3-0391dd5471fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c62ed5e5da1fa532060048ab30ebc6a, https://si.imgix.net/8d5471d5/uploads/origins/ecc1cbc0-fb85-4aec-bee3-0391dd5471fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4b42451be53b854110e1390434b1e90 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d5471d5/uploads/origins/ecc1cbc0-fb85-4aec-bee3-0391dd5471fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e92d3a80e6ea64c08a2dc6ee6d2538e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, may I request an image of my Eevee and friend's Minccino? Could the be hugging each other, with their cheeks pressed together, nuzzling each other?\n\nEevee:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/668353265909628930/1055036825951010886/NoctTheVee.png\n\nMinccino:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1107539376264712192/1159387899813441606/Cat_Ref_Sheet.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f7e6ef/uploads/origins/09c25bcb-b207-4310-9516-b14c72495df5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14377b9e2ad1c67ca791b563f313af47", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f7e6ef/uploads/origins/09c25bcb-b207-4310-9516-b14c72495df5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14377b9e2ad1c67ca791b563f313af47, https://si.imgix.net/e1f7e6ef/uploads/origins/09c25bcb-b207-4310-9516-b14c72495df5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e94a5948be33f2f3449e34dcb947ca9b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1f7e6ef/uploads/origins/09c25bcb-b207-4310-9516-b14c72495df5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f862c11698ff5fefb46073b4d20a7cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hello i really love your art i would like to commission a pmd drawing of my 5 ocs here is all info below\n\nThe background info: this is all taking place in a forest during the autumn season as we can see the falling leaves, our main characters are on a dirt path that's leading to a cave on the right. During this time it also has struck sunset so most of the sky is an orange tint, in this massive forest there also many hills and bushes too\n\nKelly is in the front of the team, she's holding a treasure map and pointing out towards the cave, she looks towards her team while pointing out that they should go in\n\nGlacier the greninja checks  his sachet, that's around his waist to make sure that he has the items they need for the dungeon so they can go in prepared\n\nLuke Is walking next to them while eating a yacha berry, and is holding a shuca berry in his other hand,\nHis bag on his tail is over filled with lots of other berries and is starting to spill out but he doesn't notice as he's trying to get a good look at the map\n\nTyler is holding Andre while walking with everyone and is looking slightly up at the autumn forest trees,he has his blue scarf on and is wearing a satchel around his waist, the satchel itself is pretty large so it fits fo the goodra to wear\n\nAndre is trying to look at Kelly's map while being held by the goodra and is taking a big interest in the the treasure that's drawn on the map\n\nkelly https://imgur.com/a/p0ZvV65\nluke https://imgur.com/a/9li9yBq\nandre https://imgur.com/a/YR4GZXO\ntyler https://imgur.com/a/crVv6gM\nglacier https://imgur.com/a/4tKY75u\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/p0ZvV65", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@toarutaro3/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c37953c/uploads/origins/73a13d8a-ab14-4f03-b6f6-366f8bbcc5b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp